+## Amended in session 15c
+
+**A plan nobody answered ends `overtaken`, written when what overtook it happens.** Opening a new ask over a pending proposal used to clear the thread and write nothing, so the proposal read as cut. Item 7 holds: the moment is known, so it is an ending, the seventh.
+
+| What came first | The run that follows |
+|---|---|
+| a new ask from the user | follows it, in its negotiation, as after `stopped` |
+| a report of the workout it adapts (the day `record_adapted` would refuse) | none |
+| the next mesocycle, prepared | opens a negotiation of its own |
+
+- `because` says which, in the machine's words. A tap on its buttons afterwards changes nothing and is told why.
+- A run the entrance opens and a subgraph carries into the negotiation it follows is one run: the reader does not count the entrance's half as a cut negotiation.
+
 ## Consequences
 
 - **`record.Run` goes.** The model, provider and budget carried in the run's config were the identity of a run answered by one model; the model belongs to the node that did the work and goes in the record's node entries.
